{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-36","level":"B1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"statt … zu · Umwelt 5","bn":"বদলে · পরিবেশ ৫"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ fernzusehen, lerne ich Deutsch. (বদলে)","answers":["Statt"],"options":["Statt","Ohne","Um"],"promptBn":"বদলে","id":"b1-practice-36-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Statt mit dem Auto zu ___, nehme ich das Fahrrad.","answers":["fahren"],"options":["fahren","fährt","gefahren"],"promptBn":"statt … zu + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-36-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er spielt am Handy, statt seine Hausaufgaben zu ___.","answers":["machen"],"options":["machen","macht","gemacht"],"promptBn":"statt … zu + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-36-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Anstatt Wasser zu ___, trinkt er Saft. (trinken)","answers":["trinken"],"options":["trinken","trinkt","getrunken"],"promptBn":"anstatt … zu + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-36-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bitte ___ Sie das Licht aus. (বন্ধ করা)","answers":["schalten"],"options":["schalten","schaltet","schalte"],"promptBn":"ausschalten: schalten … aus","id":"b1-practice-36-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Autos ___ die Luft. (দূষিত করা)","answers":["verschmutzen"],"options":["verschmutzen","verschmutzt","verschmutze"],"promptBn":"Autos → বহুবচন","id":"b1-practice-36-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ein Fahrrad ___ sich in der Stadt. (লাভজনক হওয়া)","answers":["lohnt"],"options":["lohnt","lohnen","lohne"],"promptBn":"sich lohnen: es → lohnt","id":"b1-practice-36-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir müssen die Natur ___. (রক্ষা করা)","answers":["schützen"],"options":["schützen","schützt","verursachen"],"promptBn":"müssen + infinitive","id":"b1-practice-36-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Er ging, ohne die Tür ___ schließen.","answers":["zu"],"options":["zu","um","statt"],"promptBn":"ohne … zu","id":"b1-practice-36-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich kaufe regional, ___ die Umwelt zu schützen.","answers":["um"],"options":["um","ohne","statt"],"promptBn":"উদ্দেশ্য: um … zu","id":"b1-practice-36-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Im Winter ___ wir nur zwei Zimmer. (গরম করা)","answers":["heizen"],"options":["heizen","heizt","lüften"],"promptBn":"wir → infinitive-এর রূপ","id":"b1-practice-36-q11"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir ___ Papier und Plastik. (আলাদা করা)","answers":["trennen"],"options":["trennen","trennt","trenne"],"promptBn":"wir → infinitive-এর রূপ","id":"b1-practice-36-q12"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Als ich ankam, ___ alle schon gegessen.","answers":["hatten"],"options":["hatten","hatte","haben"],"promptBn":"Plusquamperfekt, alle → hatten","id":"b1-practice-36-q13"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das Papier ___ gesammelt. (Passiv)","answers":["wird"],"options":["wird","werden","ist"],"promptBn":"Passiv: wird + Partizip II","id":"b1-practice-36-q14"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"An deiner Stelle ___ ich mehr Rad fahren.","answers":["würde"],"options":["würde","werde","wurde"],"promptBn":"পরামর্শ: An deiner Stelle würde ich …","id":"b1-practice-36-q15"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wenn die Heizung ___, frieren wir im Winter. (ভেঙে যাওয়া)","answers":["kaputtgeht"],"options":["kaputtgeht","weitergeht","abgibt"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-36-q16"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Bei 30 Grad beginnt das Eis zu ___. (গলানো)","answers":["schmelzen"],"options":["schmelzen","frieren","verbinden"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-36-q17"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Nach der Arbeit möchte ich mich ___. (বিশ্রাম নেওয়া)","answers":["ausruhen"],"options":["ausruhen","weigern","lohnen"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"b1-practice-36-q18"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Statt den Standby-Modus zu benutzen, ___ ich den Fernseher ganz ___. (বন্ধ করি)","answers":["schalte","aus"],"options":["schalte","aus","schaltet","ein"],"promptBn":"দুটি ফাঁক পূরণ করুন","explanation":"ausschalten: schalte … aus।","id":"b1-practice-36-q19"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Nina schreibt: „Ein Elektroauto ist teuer, und wir können